- Input from 'make_1_lvl1-apply_template-1' with question: 'Can you return all possible precursors of applying the template as the result of the task make_1_lvl1-template_search-1 to the molecule below?' and answer: '[["C/C(=C(c1ccccc1)C1CCC(C1=O)C(F)(F)F)"]]'


